lf start/open: launch IDEs when opening worktrees

Run `lf start feature` to create a worktree and automatically open Warp
and Cursor. Use `lf open feature` to reopen IDEs for existing worktrees.

Worktrees are created at .lf/worktrees/ (now gitignored). Added helper
function _open_worktree() to centralize IDE launching logic. Updated
command table in README.
